---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="Conatus Real Estate combines deep operational expertise with purpose-built technology to optimize single-family residential portfolios."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container--narrow">
      <p class="page-label">About</p>
      <h1>Built on operations,<br />powered by <span class="accent">technology</span></h1>

      <div class="prose">
        <p class="lead">
          Conatus Real Estate is a consulting firm focused on the intersection of
          real estate operations and technology. We work with investors and operators
          to acquire, manage, and optimize single-family residential portfolios.
        </p>

        <h2>Our Approach</h2>
        <p>
          Every engagement starts with understanding the operational reality on the ground.
          We believe that technology should serve operations, not the other way around.
          Our consulting methodology combines hands-on operational experience with
          purpose-built tooling to deliver measurable improvements.
        </p>

        <h2>What Sets Us Apart</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Operational depth</strong> &mdash; We have direct experience managing SFR portfolios, not just advising on them.</li>
          <li><strong>Technology-first mindset</strong> &mdash; We build custom tools and workflows that compound efficiency over time.</li>
          <li><strong>Data-driven decisions</strong> &mdash; Every recommendation is backed by analysis, not intuition alone.</li>
          <li><strong>Transparency</strong> &mdash; We document our methodology and share our decision-making process openly.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Focus Areas</h2>
        <p>
          Our work spans the full lifecycle of single-family residential investment:
          market analysis and acquisition targeting, due diligence and underwriting,
          asset management and optimization, and technology implementation to
          streamline operations at scale.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  h1 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }
</style>
